# A small, self-contained pyramid model for the ModelRenderer example.
o Pyramid
v -1 0 -1
v 1 0 -1
v 1 0 1
v -1 0 1
v 0 2 0
vn 0 -1 0
vn 0 0.447 -0.894
vn 0.894 0.447 0
vn 0 0.447 0.894
vn -0.894 0.447 0
s off
f 1//1 3//1 2//1
f 1//1 4//1 3//1
f 1//2 2//2 5//2
f 2//3 3//3 5//3
f 3//4 4//4 5//4
f 4//5 1//5 5//5
